### Create part
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Air filter",
  "number": "12345"
}

### Find part by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parts/1

### List paginated parts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parts?page=0&size=10

### Update part
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated air filter",
  "number": "99999"
}

### Delete part
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/parts/1
